Converting the rasters to `int16` fixed the calculation, but the final map still has limits:…it shows a single summer day in 2018, and its values are 8-bit brightness values from a camera, not physical measurements of reflected light.
A result that looks right is not the same as a result that is right, so always check your outputs against what you know about the data!
